#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055936 :tutorial/content "The **greatest common factor** (or ![](images/86/861891fd828ee3558330774b23f5dcee69976d8f302da6f1e6825bf3b4be47e6.svg)) of ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) and ![](images/2f/2fd89ffbc3140e9c2f12576c1dec2522d603c45e8b1d4128c02892f651c6e6bb.svg) is the largest expression that will divide *both* ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) and ![](images/2f/2fd89ffbc3140e9c2f12576c1dec2522d603c45e8b1d4128c02892f651c6e6bb.svg) with no remainder.\n\nTo find the GCF, we list the factors of the coefficients and then identify any variable factors the expressions have in common.\n\nThe factors of ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) are\n![](images/05/05dbff97b169f70d1dd03beb2c23670b48520c5d98a839d218db50a06518fbf6.svg)\n\nThe factors of ![](images/34/34d666f013d8ce4f2b50c0a9ab9c2b5808feb37163ba38470555867babada4ef.svg) are\n![](images/59/59919e2659e3bb232e4dbc1857c9f0eca27706bbad72aea6a55bb749706307a2.svg)\n\nThe common factors of ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) and ![](images/34/34d666f013d8ce4f2b50c0a9ab9c2b5808feb37163ba38470555867babada4ef.svg) are\n![](images/b0/b08502484874a42582d63ddfc0eda0048576d0cc460aced250ad962721d0e985.svg)\n\nThe greatest of these common factors is ![](images/fe/fe34f715005da1a8b682c9650a76785673fdf25c3b7c7546bb94824470c54caf.svg)\n\nNow we look at the variable factors. Since ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) has no variable and ![](images/2f/2fd89ffbc3140e9c2f12576c1dec2522d603c45e8b1d4128c02892f651c6e6bb.svg) contains ![](images/5a/5aac2c81021f3f9e468e7840c5f95ece35c10b894bdae19ec1d247bdeb47ac6f.svg) there are no variable factors in common.\n\nThus, the greatest common factor of ![](images/f5/f5a17e5e4e88d2fd8eed0ac09f0e02d77507121fac42d5f696cf407aaab6185c.svg) and ![](images/2f/2fd89ffbc3140e9c2f12576c1dec2522d603c45e8b1d4128c02892f651c6e6bb.svg) is ![](images/fe/fe34f715005da1a8b682c9650a76785673fdf25c3b7c7546bb94824470c54caf.svg)" :tutorial/id #uuid "b2b71877-6097-5d59-a2b8-7440bd0d5329" :tutorial/math-academy-id 1360 :tutorial/title "Introduction"}]}
